dec $flatten_keysetExpressionIR(keysetExpressionIR)

1. Case analysis on keysetExpressionIR

  1. Case (% has type simpleKeysetExpressionIR)

    1. (Let simpleKeysetExpressionIR be (keysetExpressionIR as simpleKeysetExpressionIR))

    2. Return [simpleKeysetExpressionIR]

  2. Case (% has type tupleKeysetExpressionIR)

    1. (Let (( simpleKeysetExpressionListIR )) be (keysetExpressionIR as tupleKeysetExpressionIR))

    2. Return simpleKeysetExpressionListIR

