dec $lift_prefixedNameIR_as_prefixedTypeName(prefixedNameIR)

1. Case analysis on prefixedNameIR

  1. Case (% matches pattern `_BARE %`)

    1. (Let (nameIR) be prefixedNameIR)

    2. Return ($lift_nameIR_as_typeName(nameIR) as prefixedTypeName?)

  2. Case (% matches pattern `. %`)

    1. (Let (. nameIR) be prefixedNameIR)

    2. (Let typeName'? be $lift_nameIR_as_typeName(nameIR))

    3. If ((typeName'? matches pattern (_))), then

      1. (Let ?(typeName) be typeName'?)

