relation Parameter_ok: p, TC, (annotationList direction type name initializerOpt)

1. If ((initializerOpt matches pattern `_EMPTY`)), then

  1. (Type_ok: p TC |- (type as typeOrVoid) : typeIR # typeId_fresh*)

  2. (Let B be $union_set<typeId>($bound(p, TC), ({ typeId_fresh* })))

  3. If (Type_wf: B |- typeIR holds), then

    1. (Let nameIR be $name(name))

    2. (Let parameterIR be (annotationList direction typeIR nameIR ?()))

    3. Result in parameterIR, typeId_fresh*

  3. Else Phantom#1420

1. Else Phantom#1421

2. If ((initializerOpt has type initializer)), then

  1. (Let (= expression_init) be (initializerOpt as initializer))

  2. (Type_ok: p TC |- (type as typeOrVoid) : typeIR # typeId_fresh*)

  3. (Let B be $union_set<typeId>($bound(p, TC), ({ typeId_fresh* })))

  4. If (Type_wf: B |- typeIR holds), then

