;; ../../../../../spectec/specs/p4/5-typing/5.04-typing-relation.spectec:349:1-355:34:
relation Call_action_default_ok: TC, parameterIR*, argumentIR*

1. (Let (parameterIR_data*, parameterIR_control*) be $split_dataplane_parameters(parameterIR*))

2. (Let typedExpressionIR_sub* be $subexpressions_of_argumentListIR(argumentIR*))

3. If ($forall_(~$is_table_application(typedExpressionIR_sub)*)), then

  1. (Call_convention_ok: (local) TC (action) |- parameterIR* @ argumentIR* : argumentIR_cast*)

  2. Result in parameterIR_data*, parameterIR_control*, argumentIR_cast*

3. Else Phantom#1469

;; ../../../../../spectec/specs/p4/5-typing/5.04-typing-relation.spectec:357:1-361:21:
relation TableDefaultAction_ok: TC, TBLC, (= expression)

1. Case analysis on expression

  1. Case (% has type prefixedNonTypeName)

    1. (Let prefixedNonTypeName be (expression as prefixedNonTypeName))

    2. (Let prefixedNameIR be $prefixedNonTypeName(prefixedNonTypeName))

    3. If ((?(([], [])) = $find_action(TBLC, prefixedNameIR))), then

      1. Result in (prefixedNameIR ?() ( [] ))

    3. Else Phantom#1470

  2. Case (% has type callExpression)

    1. (Let callExpression be (expression as callExpression))

    2. If ((callExpression matches pattern `% (%)`)), then

      1. (Let (callTarget ( argumentList )) be callExpression)

      2. If ((callTarget has type prefixedNonTypeName)), then

        1. (Let prefixedNonTypeName be (callTarget as prefixedNonTypeName))

        2. (Let prefixedNameIR be $prefixedNonTypeName(prefixedNonTypeName))

