              3. Else Phantom#1583

            3. Else Phantom#1584

            4. (Decl_ok: TC_0 |- (derivedTypeDeclaration as declaration) : TC_1 declarationIR)

            5. If ((declarationIR has type derivedTypeDeclarationIR)), then

              1. (Let derivedTypeDeclarationIR be (declarationIR as derivedTypeDeclarationIR))

              2. (Let ({ typeId'* }) be $diff_set<typeId>($dom_map<typeId, typeDefIR>(TC_1.global.type), $dom_map<typeId, typeDefIR>(TC_0.global.type)))

              3. If ((typeId'* matches pattern [ _/1 ])), then

