      3. If (((callableTypeIR, typeId*) has type (functionTypeIR, typeId*))), then

        1. (Let (functionTypeIR, typeId_impl*) be ((callableTypeIR, typeId*) as (functionTypeIR, typeId*)))

        2. Result in (functionTypeIR as callableTypeIR), typeId_impl*, id_default*, id_optional*

      3. Else Phantom#1621

    2. Else Phantom#1622

  4. Else Phantom#1623

1. Else Phantom#1624

2. Case analysis on callableTargetIR''

  1. Case (% matches pattern `% . %`)

    1. (Let (typedExpressionIR_base . nameIR) be callableTargetIR'')

    2. If ((typeArgumentIR* matches pattern [])), then

      1. If ((argumentIR''* matches pattern [])), then

        1. If (nameIR is in ["minSizeInBits", "minSizeInBytes", "maxSizeInBits", "maxSizeInBytes"]), then

