                  4. Result in (methodTypeIR as callableTypeIR), [], [], []

                3. Else Phantom#1629

              3. Else Phantom#1630

            4. Else Phantom#1631

          1. Else Phantom#1632

        1. Else Phantom#1633

      2. Case (% = "pop_front")

        1. If ((typeArgumentIR* matches pattern [])), then

