    1. Else Phantom#1782

1. Else Phantom#1783

2. Case analysis on keysetExpression

  1. Case (% has type expression)

    1. (Let expression be (keysetExpression as expression))

    2. If ((|typeIR'*| > 1)), then

      1. (Let typeIR_key_tuple be ((tuple < typeIR'* >) as typeIR))

