  4. Case (% has type listTypeIR)

    1. (Let (list < typeIR_param >) be (typeIR'' as listTypeIR))

    2. If ((typeIR_arg' has type listTypeIR)), then

      1. (Let (list < typeIR_arg >) be (typeIR_arg' as listTypeIR))

      2. Return $gen_constraint_pair(constraint, typeIR_param, typeIR_arg)

  5. Case (% has type tupleTypeIR)

    1. (Let (tuple < typeIR_param* >) be (typeIR'' as tupleTypeIR))

    2. If ((typeIR_arg' has type tupleTypeIR)), then

      1. (Let (tuple < typeIR_arg* >) be (typeIR_arg' as tupleTypeIR))

      2. Return $gen_constraint(constraint, typeIR_param*, typeIR_arg*)

  6. Case (% has type arrayTypeIR)

    1. (Let (array typeIR_param [ n_size ]) be (typeIR'' as arrayTypeIR))

    2. If ((typeIR_arg' has type arrayTypeIR)), then

      1. (Let (array typeIR_arg [ n_size' ]) be (typeIR_arg' as arrayTypeIR))

      2. If ((n_size = n_size')), then

