          4. Else Phantom#2086

        3. Else Phantom#2087

      2. Else Phantom#2088

    5. Else Phantom#2089

    6. (Lvalue_eval: p EC' ARCH' |- typedLvalueIR : EC_1 ARCH_1 storageReferenceResult)

    7. If ((storageReferenceResult has type continueResult<storageReference?>)), then

      1. (Let (storageReference'?) be (storageReferenceResult as continueResult<storageReference?>))

      2. If ((storageReference'? matches pattern (_))), then

