          2. (Let (header_stack [ value_element* ( n_idx ) ]) be headerStackValue)

          3. If ((nameIR = "last")), then

            1. (Let n_size be |value_element*|)

            2. If (((n_idx < 1) \/ (n_idx > n_size))), then

