;; ../../../../../spectec/specs/p4/8-dynamic/8.02-evaluation-relation.spectec:94:1-98:29:
relation Lvalue_read: p, EC', ARCH, storageReference''

1. If ((storageReference'' has type prefixedNameIR)), then

  1. (Let prefixedNameIR be (storageReference'' as prefixedNameIR))

  2. (Let value be $find_var_e(prefixedNameIR, p, EC'))

  3. Result in value

1. Else Phantom#2112

2. Case analysis on storageReference''

  1. Case (% matches pattern `% . %`)

    1. (Let (storageReference . nameIR) be storageReference'')

    2. (Lvalue_read: p EC' ARCH |- storageReference : value_base)

    3. If ((value_base has type objectReferenceValue)), then

      1. (Let (ref objectId) be (value_base as objectReferenceValue))

      2. (Let object'? be $find_object_e(ARCH, objectId))

      3. If ((object'? matches pattern (_))), then

        1. (Let ?(object) be object'?)

        2. If ((object has type packageObject)), then

          1. (Let (package < _theta > { frame }) be (object as packageObject))

          2. (Let value''? be $find_map<nameIR, value>(frame, nameIR))

