            1. (Let ?(value) be value''?)

            2. Result in value

          3. Else Phantom#2113

        2. Else Phantom#2114

      3. Else Phantom#2115

    3. Else Phantom#2116

    4. (Lvalue_read: p EC' ARCH |- storageReference : value')

    5. Case analysis on value'

      1. Case (% has type headerStackValue)

        1. (Let headerStackValue_base be (value' as headerStackValue))

        2. (Let (header_stack [ value_element* ( n_idx ) ]) be headerStackValue_base)

        3. Case analysis on nameIR

          1. Case (% = "next")

            1. (Let n_size be |value_element*|)

            2. If ((n_idx < n_size)), then

              1. (Let value be value_element*[n_idx])

              2. Result in value

            2. Else Phantom#2117

          2. Case (% = "last")

            1. (Let n_size be |value_element*|)

            2. If (~((n_idx < 1) \/ (n_idx > n_size))), then

              1. (Let n_idx_last be (n_idx - 1))

              2. (Let value be value_element*[n_idx_last])

