relation ParserBlockElementStmt_eval: EC_0, ARCH', parserBlockElementStatementIR

1. Case analysis on parserBlockElementStatementIR

  1. Case (% has type constantDeclarationIR)

    1. (Let constantDeclarationIR be (parserBlockElementStatementIR as constantDeclarationIR))

    2. (ConstDecl_eval: (local) EC_0 |- constantDeclarationIR : EC_1)

    3. Result in EC_1, ARCH', (() as parserStatementResult)

  2. Case (% has type variableDeclarationIR)

    1. (Let variableDeclarationIR be (parserBlockElementStatementIR as variableDeclarationIR))

    2. (VarDecl_eval: (local) EC_0 ARCH' |- variableDeclarationIR : EC_1 ARCH_1 declarationResult)

