1. If (((direction = ()) \/ (direction = (in)))), then

  1. (Argument_eval: p_caller EC_caller_0 ARCH_0 |- argumentIR : EC_caller_1 ARCH_1 expressionResult)

  2. Case analysis on expressionResult

    1. Case (% has type abortResult)

