  2. Case (% matches pattern `OUT`)

    1. (Argument_eval_lvalue: p_caller EC_caller_0 ARCH_0 |- argumentIR : EC_caller_1 ARCH_1 storageReferenceResult)

    2. Case analysis on storageReferenceResult

      1. Case (% has type abortResult)

        1. (Let abortResult be (storageReferenceResult as abortResult))

        2. Result in ARCH_1, EC_caller_1, EC_callee_0, (abortResult as copyInArgumentResult)

      2. Case (% has type continueResult<storageReference?>)

        1. (Let (storageReference?) be (storageReferenceResult as continueResult<storageReference?>))

        2. (Let typeIR_subst be $subst_type_e(p_callee, EC_callee_0, typeIR))

        3. (Let value_init be $default(typeIR_subst))

        4. (Let EC_callee_1 be $add_var_e(p_callee, EC_callee_0, (nameIR), value_init))

