      1. Case (% has type abortResult)

        1. (Let abortResult be (simpleKeysetExpressionResult as abortResult))

        2. Result in EC_1, ARCH_1, (abortResult as keysetExpressionResult)

      2. Case (% has type continueResult<setValue>)

        1. (Let (setValue_h) be (simpleKeysetExpressionResult as continueResult<setValue>))

        2. (Eval_keysets_simple: EC_1 ARCH_1 |- simpleKeysetExpressionIR_t* : EC_2 ARCH_2 keysetExpressionResult)

        3. If ((keysetExpressionResult has type abortResult)), then

          1. (Let abortResult be (keysetExpressionResult as abortResult))

          2. Result in EC_2, ARCH_2, (abortResult as keysetExpressionResult)

        3. Else Phantom#2373

        4. (Eval_keysets_simple: EC_1 ARCH_1 |- simpleKeysetExpressionIR_t* : EC_2 ARCH_2 keysetExpressionResult')

        5. If ((keysetExpressionResult' has type continueResult<setValue*>)), then

          1. (Let (setValue_t*) be (keysetExpressionResult' as continueResult<setValue*>))

          2. (Let keysetExpressionResult be ((setValue_h :: setValue_t*) as keysetExpressionResult))

          3. Result in EC_2, ARCH_2, keysetExpressionResult

        5. Else Phantom#2374

