        1. (ForUpdateStmts_eval: EC_1 ARCH_1 |- forUpdateStatementIR_t* : EC_2 ARCH_2 statementResult)

        2. Result in EC_2, ARCH_2, statementResult

      2. Else Phantom#2377

    5. Else Phantom#2378

