  4. If ((initializerOptIR matches pattern (_))), then

    1. (Let ?((= typedExpressionIR_init)) be initializerOptIR)

    2. (Expr_eval: (local) EC_0 ARCH' |- typedExpressionIR_init : EC_1 ARCH_1 expressionResult)

    3. Case analysis on expressionResult

      1. Case (% has type abortResult)

        1. (Let abortResult be (expressionResult as abortResult))

        2. Result in EC_1, ARCH_1, (abortResult as statementResult)

      2. Case (% has type continueResult<value>)

        1. (Let (value_init) be (expressionResult as continueResult<value>))

        2. (Let EC_2 be $add_var_e((local), EC_1, (nameIR), value_init))

