  4. Else Phantom#2380

1. Else Phantom#2381

2. If ((forInitStatementIR has type forUpdateStatementIR)), then

  1. (Let forUpdateStatementIR be (forInitStatementIR as forUpdateStatementIR))

  2. (ForUpdateStmt_eval: EC_0 ARCH' |- forUpdateStatementIR : EC_1 ARCH_1 statementResult)

