2. Case analysis on keysetExpressionResult

  1. Case (% has type rejectTransitionResult)

    1. (Let rejectTransitionResult be (keysetExpressionResult as rejectTransitionResult))

    2. Result in EC_1, ARCH_1, (rejectTransitionResult as selectCaseMatchResult)

  2. Case (% has type continueResult<setValue*>)

    1. (Let (setValue*) be (keysetExpressionResult as continueResult<setValue*>))

    2. Case analysis on $match_keysets(setValue*, value_key*)

      1. Case false

        1. Result in EC_1, ARCH_1, ((?()) as selectCaseMatchResult)

      2. Case true

        1. Result in EC_1, ARCH_1, ((?(nameIR)) as selectCaseMatchResult)

2. Else Phantom#2425

;; ../../../../../spectec/specs/p4/8-dynamic/8.08.1-eval-parser-statement.spectec:48:1-53:67:
relation SelectCases_match: EC', ARCH', value_key*, selectCaseIR*

1. Case analysis on selectCaseIR*

  1. Case (% matches pattern [])

    1. Result in EC', ARCH', ((?()) as selectCaseMatchResult)

  2. Case (% matches pattern _ :: _)

    1. (Let selectCaseIR_h :: selectCaseIR_t* be selectCaseIR*)

    2. (SelectCase_match: EC' ARCH' value_key* |- selectCaseIR_h : EC_1 ARCH_1 selectCaseMatchResult)

    3. Case analysis on selectCaseMatchResult

      1. Case (% has type rejectTransitionResult)

        1. (Let rejectTransitionResult be (selectCaseMatchResult as rejectTransitionResult))

        2. Result in EC_1, ARCH_1, (rejectTransitionResult as selectCaseMatchResult)

      2. Case (% has type continueResult<nameIR?>)

        1. (Let (nameIR?) be (selectCaseMatchResult as continueResult<nameIR?>))

        2. If ((nameIR? matches pattern (_))), then

          1. (Let ?(nameIR_state) be nameIR?)

          2. Result in EC_1, ARCH_1, ((?(nameIR_state)) as selectCaseMatchResult)

        2. Else Phantom#2426

    4. (SelectCase_match: EC' ARCH' value_key* |- selectCaseIR_h : EC_1 ARCH_1 selectCaseMatchResult')

    5. If ((selectCaseMatchResult' = ((?()) as selectCaseMatchResult))), then

      1. (SelectCases_match: EC_1 ARCH_1 value_key* |- selectCaseIR_t* : EC_2 ARCH_2 selectCaseMatchResult)

      2. Result in EC_2, ARCH_2, selectCaseMatchResult

    5. Else Phantom#2427

