   | tableMatch? (from continueResult<tableMatch?>)
   | exit (from exitResult)

;; ../../../../../spectec/specs/p4/8-dynamic/8.09.1-eval-control-table.spectec:94:1-99:61:
relation TableMatch_eval: EC_0, ARCH_0, tableKeyValue*, tableEntryIR

1. (Let (_constOptIR tableEntryPriorityIR? keysetExpressionIR : tableActionReferenceIR _annotationList ;) be tableEntryIR)

2. (Let n_priority? be $get_tableEntryPriority(tableEntryPriorityIR?))

3. (Eval_keyset: EC_0 ARCH_0 |- keysetExpressionIR : EC_1 ARCH_1 keysetExpressionResult)

4. Case analysis on keysetExpressionResult

  1. Case (% has type exitResult)

    1. (Let exitResult be (keysetExpressionResult as exitResult))

    2. If ((exitResult matches pattern `EXIT`)), then

      1. Result in EC_1, ARCH_1, ((exit) as tableMatchResult)

    2. Else Phantom#2433

  2. Case (% has type continueResult<setValue*>)

    1. (Let (setValue*) be (keysetExpressionResult as continueResult<setValue*>))

    2. (Let (value_key : _nameIR) be tableKeyValue)*

    3. Case analysis on $match_keysets(setValue*, value_key*)

      1. Case false

