relation TableMatches_eval: EC', ARCH', tableKeyValue*, tableEntryIR*

1. Case analysis on tableEntryIR*

  1. Case (% matches pattern [])

    1. Result in EC', ARCH', (([]) as tableMatchesResult)

  2. Case (% matches pattern _ :: _)

    1. (Let tableEntryIR_h :: tableEntryIR_t* be tableEntryIR*)

    2. (TableMatch_eval: EC' ARCH' |- tableKeyValue* @ tableEntryIR_h : EC_1 ARCH_1 tableMatchResult)

    3. Case analysis on tableMatchResult

      1. Case (% has type exitResult)

        1. (Let exitResult be (tableMatchResult as exitResult))

