relation Copy_out_inner: ARCH, p_caller, EC_caller', parameterIR*, p_callee, EC_callee, storageReference?*

1. Case analysis on parameterIR*

  1. Case (% matches pattern [])

    1. If ((storageReference?* matches pattern [])), then

      1. Result in EC_caller'

    1. Else Phantom#2446

  2. Case (% matches pattern _ :: _)

    1. (Let parameterIR_h :: parameterIR_t* be parameterIR*)

    2. If ((storageReference?* matches pattern _ :: _)), then

      1. (Let storageReference_h? :: storageReference_t?* be storageReference?*)

      2. (Copy_out_argument: ARCH |- p_caller EC_caller' parameterIR_h @ p_callee EC_callee storageReference_h? ~> EC_caller_1)

      3. (Copy_out_inner: ARCH |- p_caller EC_caller_1 parameterIR_t* @ p_callee EC_callee storageReference_t?* ~> EC_caller_2)

      4. Result in EC_caller_2

