2. (Let blockEvalLayer be {type $empty_theta, callable $empty_callableDefEnv, state $empty_stateEnv, frame $empty_frame})

3. (Let localEvalLayer be {type $empty_theta, frames [$empty_frame]})

4. (Let EC be {global globalEvalLayer, block blockEvalLayer, local localEvalLayer})

5. Result in EC, STO

