8. Else Phantom#2483

9. (Stmt_eval: (global) EC_0 ARCH_0 |- ((callableTargetIR < [] > ( argumentIR* ) ;) as statementIR) : EC_1 ARCH_1 statementResult)

10. If ((statementResult has type exitResult)), then

